      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is to introduce a combined infusion analgesia for postoperative pain treatment. The analgetic efficiency would increase by combining analgetic substances specifically focussed. This method has the enormous advantage not to be limited to the intensive care; it might be applied to any peripheral surgery. Its main and side effects have been tested in 25 gastrectomized patients, postoperatively."},
